    Component {
      Type          Subsystem
      Name          "CurrentVectorController"
      Show          on
      Position      [720, 135]
      Direction     up
      Flipped       off
      LabelPosition south
      Frame         [-50, -50; 50, 50]
      SampleTime    "-1"
      CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
      CodeGenTarget "Generic"
      MaskType      "CurrentVectorController (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Current-vector controller (CurrentVectorController). The configuration cfg is a struct with the fields of CurrentVectorControllerCfg ([] = None, i.e., the default; the default observer gain k_o and the continuous-time current controller only). The mask initialization resolves the defaults and passes the parameters to the blocks inside it, as CurrentVectorController. The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, R_R, L_sgm, and L_M of InductionMachineInvGammaPars."
      MaskInit      "% Default of alpha_o (CurrentVectorControllerCfg.__post_init__)\nalpha_o = cfg.alpha_o;\nif isempty(alpha_o)\n  alpha_o = 2*pi*60;\n  if ~isempty(cfg.J)\n    alpha_o = 0.5*alpha_o;\n  end\nend\n% Default of alpha_i (CurrentController.__init__)\nalpha_i = cfg.alpha_i;\nif isempty(alpha_i)\n  alpha_i = cfg.alpha_c;\nend\n"
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
        Variable      "par"
        Prompt        "par: Machine model (InductionMachineInvGammaPars) as a struct"
        Type          FreeText
